b.add(S3, 328, "match", "Match the five differential diagnoses in printed order — 1) First 2) Second 3) Third 4) Fourth 5) Fifth … A) Bilateral renal-artery stenosis → flash pulmonary edema B) Acute coronary syndrome C) Takotsubo cardiomyopathy D) Acute AR/MR E) Myocarditis", "1-B, 2-D, 3-E, 4-A, 5-C", ["1-D, 2-B, 3-E, 4-A, 5-C", "1-B, 2-D, 3-A, 4-E, 5-C", "1-B, 2-E, 3-D, 4-A, 5-C"], "The list runs ACS, acute AR/MR, myocarditis, bilateral renal-artery stenosis with flash pulmonary edema and Takotsubo cardiomyopathy.")
