b.add(S3, 328, "management", "Which treatment arms are printed around the flowchart?", "Stable disease; hypovolemia; natriuretic peptides/nesiritide or vasodilators (nitroprusside or nitroglycerin); inotropic drugs (dobutamine, milrinone, calcium sensitizers); and pulmonary edema with cardiogenic shock", ["Immediate transplant; dialysis; antibiotics; thrombolysis; pericardiectomy", "AVR; TAVR; balloon valvotomy; ICD; CRT", "Naproxen; verapamil; diltiazem; digoxin; vitamin K"], "The labels around the 2×2 chart are stable, hypovolemia, natriuretic peptides/nesiritide or nitroprusside/nitroglycerin, inotropic drugs and pulmonary edema + cardiogenic shock.")
