b.add(S4, 329, "numeric", "What IV furosemide dose and division are printed for acute pulmonary edema?", "360 mg total, divided as 100 mg + 100 mg + 100 mg + 60 mg", ["360 mg once", "100 mg + 60 mg + 40 mg + 20 mg", "5–10 mg once"], "The IV-bolus bracket reads 360 mg furosemide split into 100, 100, 100 and 60 mg.")
